    "text": "fox10phoenix.com\nwebsite\nTempe\nTempe red light & speed cameras: Checking in on the numbers so far\nBy Jessica Johnson,\n3 hours agoTEMPE, Ariz. - The city of Tempe's photo radar enforcement program has been issuing citations for over a month now. From June 6 to July 9, the cameras captured almost 20,000 violations. Out of those violations, more than 3,600 tickets were issued, and nearly 2,800 notices of violation were sent...\n2",
